# NAME: ATAS
# TYPE: program
# REPO: https://github.com/kevshen13/surge-rules
# UPDATED: 2026-11-12
# ROUTING: Choose an independent policy for each list; app and feed exits need not match.
# ORDER: Place data-source DOMAIN/IP rules before program PROCESS-NAME rules.
# GATEWAY: PROCESS-NAME identifies only processes on the Surge host, not remote LAN PCs.
# SOURCE: https://atas.net/connections/
# NOTE: Broker/feed destinations are handled by their own earlier rules; this list is the program/site fallback.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,atas.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,orderflowtrading.net
PROCESS-NAME,ATAS
PROCESS-NAME,ATAS X
PROCESS-NAME,ATASX
PROCESS-NAME,OFT.Platform
